    "detailed_description": "Industry Mania is a casual and time management video game. This game utilizes a point-and-click arcade gameplay model that enables the player to manage the production processes on a workplace using a mouse. In this game you can recruit workers, give workers salaries, manage energy resources, operate factories, collect products, sell products, and make even more cash.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou have to complete the task within the given time to beat the levels and then unlock new workers and factories. These business fields consist of: forestry, mining, fisheries, animal husbandry, food, chemicals, machinery, and aircraft.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIndustry Mania game features:<br />\r\n\u2022 22 levels to beat<br />\r\n\u2022 Four workers to pay for<br />\r\n\u2022 Eight factories to run<br />\r\n\u2022 Eight industrial products to sell<br />\r\n\u2022 Relaxing background music",
